# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
# A change waiting while a section loops lands as the loop goes round. The first song's intro is 8 bars at 81 BPM
# (2963 ms a bar): Loop on (Sections, K1), the comp's instrument changed from the main screen (PRESET turned on the comp
# tile) in the intro's sixth bar. Its 4-bar line is the intro's end, which the loop never reaches: it lands at the
# loop's restart instead, the intro's first bar.
listen
wait 1400
tap PLAY
wait 1000
tap SEL
wait 50
said SECTIONS
turn K1 1
wait 50
said LOOP ON
tap SEL
wait 50
expect home 1
spin ALGO 3
wait 50
# bar 6 of 8 (from 0: 5), about 15.8 s in
wait 14800
expect bar 5
remember
turn PRESET 1
wait 50
expect pending >0
# round the loop (the wrap 23.7 s in): the intro again, the change in
wait 9000
expect section 0
expect bar 0
expect pending -1
expect same_comp 0
expect same_song 1
